{"path": "dino-game.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Khủng Lỏng Runner 🦖 - Game giống Chrome</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f7f7f7;
    --ink: #535353;
    --dino: #535353;
    --cactus: #535353;
    --red: #e63946;
  }
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
    background: var(--bg);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
